# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FootyPredict environment variables
#
# IMPORTANT — RapidAPI key location:
#   The RapidAPI key is consumed by the Vercel serverless functions in /api
#   (see lib/rapidapi.ts). Set it as a SERVER-SIDE env var in Vercel — never
#   in this file, and never in the client bundle:
#
#     RAPIDAPI_KEY=your-rapidapi-key-here
#     PREDICTIONS_KEY=fallback-key  (optional alias)
#
# The optional variables below are only used as a LOCAL/client-side fallback
# when the serverless functions are unreachable (e.g. running `npm run dev`
# outside Vercel). Leave them unset in production.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Optional client-side fallback key for local development ONLY (not recommended).
# VITE_RAPIDAPI_KEY=

# Optional Paystack public key override for the checkout page.
# VITE_PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=

# Paystack SECRET key — used SERVER-SIDE by api/paystack-verify.ts to verify
# transactions before premium is granted. Set this in Vercel, never in the
# client bundle:
# PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY=
